    "scriptCode": "\nfloat offset = 0.8 + 0.2 * sin(t * 2.0);\nvec3 p1 = p - vec3(-offset, 0.0, 0.0);\nvec3 p2 = p - vec3( offset, 0.0, 0.0);\nfloat d1 = length(vec2(length(p1.xy) - A, p1.z)) - B;\nfloat d2 = length(vec2(length(p2.xy) - A, p2.z)) - B;\nfloat h = clamp(0.5 + 0.5 * (d2 - d1) / C, 0.0, 1.0);\nreturn mix(d2, d1, h) - C * h * (1.0 - h);",
